{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "07", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "18", "M": "27", "S": "20"}}, "news": [{"title": "Eye on New Noida, land rates increased by 53%", "para": "In a move to facilitate the New Noida project, the Noida Authority has increased land acquisition compensation rates, offering a 53% rise for farmers opting for developed plots. This strategy aims to encourage cooperation from landowners during the acquisition process. The ambitious New Noida project is set to become a modern smart city and industrial hub, with land acquisition planned in four phases until the year 2041.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/eye-on-new-noida-land-rates-increased-by-53/133884847?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-467512/133884847.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Sachin Tendulkar buys 3.86-acre land parcel in Lonavala for \u20b970 crore", "para": "Cricketer Sachin Tendulkar has acquired over 3.9 acres of land in Lonavala for a combined \u20b970 crore through three registered transactions. The parcels, spanning 15,601.78 sq m, include an existing built-up structure. Tendulkar paid about \u20b94.20 crore in stamp duty, according to registration documents accessed through Zapkey.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/sachin-tendulkar-buys-3-86-acre-land-parcel-in-lonavala-for-70-crore/133884709?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-94556/133884709.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "UK house prices fall 0.4% in August 2026: Lloyds data", "para": "In August, British house prices experienced their first yearly decline in nearly three years, driven by higher borrowing costs that dissuaded potential buyers. Economists predict continued softness in the housing mar